From 7b730d9da6bcf084213102d913f7232cef114ace Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Wed, 27 May 2026 19:12:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: Remove Cohere, fix AI conversation/copilot, improve
 Shopify integration

Major fixes:
1. AI Conversation (Simulator): Fixed broken AI by removing Cohere dependency,
   using Groq (llama-3.3-70b-versatile) as primary and Gemini 2.0 Flash as fallback.
   Fixed critical bug in bot.js where lastError was a label statement instead of
   assignment (lastError: providerError -> lastError = providerError).
   Updated index.js from deprecated model names (meta-llama/llama-4-scout,
   gemini-1.5-flash) to current ones (llama-3.3-70b-versatile, gemini-2.0-flash).

2. AI Copilot: Removed Cohere from provider fallback chain in chat/route.js
   and agent/route.js. Now uses Groq -> Gemini -> OpenAI chain.
   Updated error messages to not reference Cohere.

3. Shopify Integration: Added proper HMAC verification in webhooks route.
   Implemented app/uninstalled handler to clean up DB records.
   Code is structurally correct - needs SHOPIFY_API_KEY and SHOPIFY_API_SECRET
   env vars to function (documented in .env).

4. WhatsApp Webhook: Fixed generateAIReply() call that was passing wrong
   parameters (was missing accountId, customerId, plan, etc.). Now correctly
   passes all required parameters matching the function signature.

5. Plan Limits: Updated AI model mapping to use Groq/Gemini instead of
   OpenAI for smart and premium tiers.

6. Added .env template with all required keys documented.
